 tudent Center "The Underground" (across from 1908)\n \nWednesday\, Septem
 ber 23 6-8pm\nStudent Rec Multi Purpose Room 2\n \n \nPLEASE COME TO AUDI
 TIONS IN COMFORTABLE ATTIRE AND ON TIME FOR CHECK IN!\nCome in confident 
 and your true self\, and express it all through dance:)\nAuditions will s
 tart right away\, so please be there on time and get ready to stretch and
  learn!\n \nPlease only fill out this form if you are planning to attend 
 auditions :)\n \nIf you have any questions\, feel free to DM us on instag
 ram @montclairdynasty or feel free to email us montclairdynasty@sgamsu.or
 g\n \n\nGood luck\, and we hope you make it to the DDC Crew💙.\n\n**Open 
