DESCRIPTION:Empanada Fundraiser Sale! 🌟Support a great cause and enjoy de
 licious\, homemade empanadas!\nThe Hermanos Of La Unidad Latina\, Lambda 
 Upsilon Lambda Fraternity Inc.\, are hosting a special empanada and agua 
 fresca sale to raise funds for our Spring 2027 scholarship and The Floren
 ce Immigrant & Refugee Rights Project. Every bite helps make a difference
