DESCRIPTION:Wondering how your strengths can shape your future? This inter
 active workshop will help you discover and build on the skills that matte
 r most to you. In this session\, you’ll:\nIdentify your skills and streng
 ths through self-assessment.\nDetermine how those skills connect to possi
 ble majors and career paths.\nCreate an action plan to grow your skills u
 sing the Discovery Program's AI-powered Major Mentor. Additionally\, Majo
 r Mentor will help you map majors that align with your strengths and prov
 ide real next steps.\nSkills in Action: Mapping Your Strengths to Majors 
 is part of Academic Exploration Week\, a longstanding immersive experienc
 e presented by The Discovery Program. To contact the Discovery Program\, 
 email us at discoveryprogram@montclair.edu\, or visit us at montclair.edu
 /discovery-program.\n\nHosted by: The Discovery Program\n\nAdditional Inf
 ormation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/1
 2497626
