DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, we will explore the fundamental elements th
 at make up a sentence in Spanish. We will learn to correctly identify and
  use the subject\, verb\, object\, article\, and adjective.\nThis worksho
 p will help participants understand and familiarize themselves with the g
 rammatical vocabulary commonly used in language classes. Through practica
 l examples and interactive exercises\, participants will construct clear 
 and grammatically correct sentences\, thereby strengthening the foundatio
 ns of written and oral communication in Spanish.\n\nHosted by: Center for
