 tic clues. The more connections you crack\, the more points you earn. Wil
 l your group uncover the truth… or will the mystery remain unsolved?\nMaj
 or Mystery is part of Academic Exploration Week\, a longstanding immersiv
 e experience presented by The Discovery Program. To contact the Discovery
