  Students $10\n\n \nWhere and when?\n\nSeptember 26th\, 2026\n11am-5pm\nL
 eaves from Student Recreation Center\n\n \nWhat to bring: Water\, sneaker
 s and a sense of adventure!\n \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather 
 changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/pois
 onous plants\, insect bites\, and injury by running\, including sprains\,
  lacerations\, abrasions and fractures.\n \n\nHosted by: Campus Recreatio
 n\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs
