CATEGORIES:Cultural/Community
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Festival de los Andes on Saturday\, September 
 26\, from 2:00–7:00 p.m. at the Amphitheater! Celebrate the rich cultures
  and traditions of the Andean countries through an afternoon of live musi
 c\, traditional dance\, artists and artisans\, interactive workshops\, ra
 ffle and prizes\, food\, and ALPACAS! This vibrant cultural festival brin
 gs together the Montclair State University community\, families\, Indigen
 ous groups\, artists\, and local communities to experience the music\, ar
 t\, traditions\, and creativity of the Andes. Free and open to the public
 .\nPLEASE RSVP!\n\nHosted by: Association of Latino Professionals For Ame
 rica\, Bloomfield Beta Kappa Sigma Sorority\, Black and Latina Sorority I
 nc.\, Bloomfield Lambda Sigma Upsilon Latino Fraternity\, Inc.\, Center f
 or Latino Heritage & Spanish Language Excellence\, Dominican Student Orga
 nization\, Latin American Student Organization\, Latin@ Caucus\, Mexican-
 American Student Association\, Office for Hispanic Initiatives\, Puerto R
 ican Student Organization\, Peruvian-American Student Organization\, Span
 ish and Latino Studies\, The Latino Medical Student Association PLUS\n\nA
 dditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/e
 ngage/event/12626394
DTEND:20260926T230000Z
