 r do any other fiber art you're interested in. You don't need any experie
 nce to join! We have all the supplies you could need\, and they're free f
 or you to use and keep. Come learn how to make plushies\, accessories\, a
 nd clothes! \nAll are welcome at Unraveled\, no matter how much or how li
 ttle experience you have! Come to learn\, work on your own projects\, and
  hang out with other people who have the same hobby as you :). \n\nHosted
  by: Montclair Unraveled\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https
 ://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12764287
