DESCRIPTION:Coordinating with the release of the dam in the Lehigh River\,
  this whitewater rafting trip is sure to be a blast. Perfect for all skil
 l levels. This is a great way to GET YOUR FEET WET! \n \nHow do I Sign-up
 ?\n\nRegister here\, or in the Student Recreation Center's main office\, 
 or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students  $20 \n\n \nWhere an
 d when?\n\nSaturday\, October 10\, 2026\n7:00am – 7:00pm\nBegins at Stude
 nt Recreation Center\n\n \nWhat to bring: Lunch\, water\, snacks\, towel\
 , a change of clothes and sandals with a heel strap\, old sneakers\, or w
 ater shoes. Flip-flops or slides are not allowed. For warmer days\, wear 
 a swim suit or quick-drying shorts/shirt\; for cooler days\, bring extra 
 layers\, but no cotton. Wetsuits are included for those that want them.Ha
 lf/full wetsuits can be rented from the organization. Half is $6\, full i
 s $12\, jacket is $4. \n \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather chang
 es\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, limited vision\, dehydration\, allergic re
 actions/poisonous plants\, insect bites and injury by running\, including
  sprains\, lacerations\, abrasions and fractures.\n\nHosted by: Campus Re
 creation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.cam
 puslabs.com/engage/event/12543558
DTEND:20261010T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T042233Z
DTSTART:20261010T110000Z
LOCATION:Begins at Student Recreation Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Whitewater Rafting Trip
